ctive Custody<br/>(Giorgio's Betrayal & Precinct Ambush)\"]\r\n105: 248:     \r\n106: 249:     subgraph Endgame_Gauntlet[\"Final Lockdown Gauntlet\"]\r\n107: 250:         M101 -->|\"Proceed Prompt\"| M102[\"102. The End of the Road<br/>(Penthouse Assault & Keys Escape)\"]\r\n108: 251:     end\r\n109: 252:     \r\n110: 253:     subgraph Endings[\"Branching Resolutions\"]\r\n111: 254:         M102 --> E1[\"Ending A: Bonnie & Clyde<br/>★ Canonical Ending ★<br/>(Choice: Trust Partner; Rewards $2M Payout)\"]\r\n112: 255:         M102 --> E2[\"Ending B: The Deal<br/>⚡ Fastest Any% Speedrun Ending ⚡<br/>(Accept Mendez's Immunity Plea; Skips Swamp Chase)\"]\r\n113: 256:         M102 --> E3[\"Ending C: The Sacrifice<br/>(Choice: Solo Heroic Extraction Fallback)\"]\r\n114: 257:     end\r\n115: 258: ```\r\n116: 259: \r\n117: 260: ---\r\n118: 261: \r\n119: 262: ## 7. Prerequisite & Unlock Reference Matrix\r\n120: 263: \r\n121: 264: | Chapter | Mission Name | Mandatory Prerequisite | Unlocked Feature / Consequence |\r\n122: 265: | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\r\n123: 266: | **Ch. 1** | **Prologue** | Starting Game | Story start; Lucia introduction |\r\n124: 267: | **Ch. 1** | **Gone Fishing** | Prologue | Introduces Jason; petty smuggling |\r\n125: 268: | **Ch. 1** | **Island Dreams** | Hey Arnold! | Unlocks Kenton Sets & ocean diving |\r\n126: 269: | **Ch. 1** | **Coming Home** | Feng Shui | Lucia released from Hamlet Penitentiary |\r\n127: 270: | **Ch. 1** | **Tourist Trap** | Recalibration | Initiates Chapter 1 finale sequence |\r\n128: 271: | **Ch. 1** | **Discharge Time** | Home Sweet Home | Hard transition to Port Gellhorn (Chapter 2) |\r\n129: 272: | **Ch. 2** | **Moses** | Girls' Trip | Unlocks vehicle fencing & custom car registrations |\r\n130: 273: | **Ch. 2** | **Coffee Break** | Breakfast Run | **Permanently unlocks dual-character switching** |\r\n131: 274: | **Ch. 2** | **Hit Avery Pawn** | Coffee Break | Unlocks store/business stickup mechanics |\r\n132: 275: | **C